equired, type and size checks; see ",[283,642,644],{"href":643},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fphone-file\u002Ffile#with-form-validation","With form validation"," on the File page.",[647,648,649,650,367],"note",{},"Dates and options are currently only checked for being required. Add rules for date formats, whether an option is still valid, cross-field conditions, numeric ranges and so on as needed, for example ",[258,651,652],{},"v.pipe(v.number(), v.minValue(1), v.maxValue(100))",[275,654,656],{"id":655},"empty-values-and-types","Empty values and types",[254,658,659,660,663,664,667,668,671,672,674,675,678,679,683,684,687,688,636,691,694,695,697],{},"Components write ",[258,661,662],{},"null"," \u002F ",[258,665,666],{},"undefined"," bound by the parent back as the agreed empty value (",[258,669,670],{},"''"," for text, ",[258,673,662],{}," for numbers, ",[258,676,677],{},"[]"," for date ranges and so on; see ",[283,680,682],{"href":681},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#empty-values","Empty values","). Unexpected values are cleared, and most components also log a ",[258,685,686],{},"console.warn"," (",[258,689,690],{},"ShuoSelectMenu",[258,692,693],{},"ShuoMonths"," only clear without warning; see the same section). An unselected radio group is ",[258,696,670],{},", so options should not use an empty string as their value.",[254,699,700,701,663,703,705,706,632,709,712],{},"The input types of the shared schemas accept ",[258,702,662],{},[258,704,666],{}," while editing, and the output after validation narrows to ",[258,707,708],{},"string",[258,710,711],{},"number"," or an array of the item type, so you do not need to change the components' empty-value contract.",[275,714,716],{"id":715},"display-and-interaction","Display and interaction",[718,719,720,728,746],"ul",{},[721,722,723,724,727],"li",{},"We recommend the built-in theme (",[258,725,726],{},"theme: true",") for error messages: a floating style inset in the field's bottom border that does not add to the field height. Keep enough spacing between fields, and avoid clipping overflowing content in the containers.",[721,729,730,733,734,737,738,741,742,745],{},[258,731,732],{},"UForm"," only fires ",[258,735,736],{},"@submit"," after validation passes; read the validated data from ",[258,739,740],{},"event.data",". When validation fails, ",[258,743,744],{},"@error"," fires.",[721,747,748,749,752],{},"Use the default validation timing on input, blur and change. When resetting, besides clearing the state, call the form's ",[258,750,751],{},"clear()"," to clear the errors.",[754,755,756],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: